&lt;li&gt;CI/CD tooling (Jenkins, GitHub Actions, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source Control Management (GitHub, SVN, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting (Bash, PowerShell, Python, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
